lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8b7bacbf_20260502_093450/review_16_attempt_1.log:1894:# Change: 8连通追踪（path_tracing）——从边缘种子像素出发，沿8连通（含对角线）的非背景像素追踪出完整线路组件... → 混合连通追踪（线用8连通，腔体判定用8连通）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/3d31c5b3.py:8:    Collapse four stacked same-size color masks into one mask by overlaying them with a fixed band priority.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/3d31c5b3.py:16:    - At each local position, output the first foreground pixel found in priority\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/3d31c5b3.py:63:# Palette and overlay priority: colors are fixed to match the eval pattern.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8b7bacbf_20260502_093450/review_11_attempt_1.log:73:  - 当前值: 8连通追踪（path_tracing）——从边缘种子像素出发，沿8连通（含对角线）的非背景像素追踪出完整线路组件\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8b7bacbf_20260502_093450/review_11_attempt_1.log:81:  - 当前值: 三步流程：(1)识别边缘种子像素→(2)追踪每个种子连接的线路→(3)填充沿线的闭合腔体\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/spce_dis/spec_train/79cce52d_spec.yaml:25:    - generate a 6x6 payload by flood-fill or random Voronoi tiling with the 6 payload colors; ensure full coverage, each color >= 4 cells\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8b7bacbf_20260502_093450/review_7_attempt_1.log:2486:    current: \"8连通追踪（path_tracing）——从边缘种子像素出发，沿8连通（含对角线）的非背景像素追踪出完整线路组件\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8b7bacbf_20260502_093450/review_7_attempt_1.log:2629:        description: \"双向颜色交换：腔体用种子色填充，同时种子像素变为对应框架环的颜色。解题者需要追踪双向的颜色传递关系，增加了推理的对称性和复杂度。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8b7bacbf_20260502_093450/review_7_attempt_1.log:2658:    current: \"三步流程：(1)识别边缘种子像素→(2)追踪每个种子连接的线路→(3)填充沿线的闭合腔体\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8b7bacbf_20260502_093450/review_7_attempt_1.log:2671:        description: \"增加第四步：在填充所有腔体后，将连接路径（线路颜色像素）擦除为背景色。最终输出中只有种子像素、框架环和填充后的腔体，路径消失。解题者需要理解路径是临时的'指导线'。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8b7bacbf_20260502_093450/report.json:849:    \"description\": \"网格中有多个视觉相似的候选种子像素（含边缘位置的假种子），真种子位于非边缘位置。solver需通过唯一性验证（如真种子是唯一能8连通到达框架环的像素）来区分真